- In the lexicon loading loop: `if lx["strongs"]: norm_lex[lx["strongs"]] = lx` → keys "H1", "H2", etc.
- When looking up "H7225" in `norm_lex`: `nfc_clean = unicodedata.normalize('NFC', "H7225")` → "H7225" is in `norm_lex` because it was keyed by strongs!

